# M7 (b): spells that become something else when cast.
# Overload: no targets, "target" reads as "each" (Cyclonic Rift).
cast:overload
cast_row:overload
# Fuse: both halves as one spell (Wear/Tear).
cast:fused
cast_row:fuse
# Adventure: the back face, exiled as it resolves, then the card from exile (Brazen Borrower).
cast:adventure
cast_row:adventure
cast_row:exile_mana_cost
# Bestow: an Aura while cast (Springheart Nantuko), and what its landfall pays for.
cast:bestow
cast_row:bestow
effect:CopyPermanent
category:PAY_UNLESS
# Prepare: the copy in exile cast (Carnivorous Cultivator).
cast:prepared
cast_row:prepared
# An alternative cost with two conditions (Massacre) among the plain ones.
cast_row:alternative
